Date: Sat, 27 Jun 2026 12:12:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(dora): remove hardcoded projects, add opt-out recording,
 auto-setup flow
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Remove DEFAULT_PROJECTS dict — no hardcoded keys, board IDs, repos, or
  Dokploy compose IDs. All project config lives in
  docs/planning-artifacts/project-dora-config.md only.
- load_project_config() returns None if project not in file → triggers
  interactive setup_project() rather than silently using stale defaults.
- run_setup() now asks Y/n per service (Jira / GitHub / Dokploy). Saying
  no writes .secrets/skip-{service}.txt so it is never asked again.
- collect_* functions check skip flags first; missing-credential warnings
  now say 'run --setup' instead of just printing and continuing.
- main() checks for missing creds on non-skipped services and offers to
  run setup inline before proceeding.
- Updated SKILL.md to document skip flags and remove hardcoded project table.
